        1886,
        1905
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I further direct that you instruct a representative of your department to pick up the census canvass forms at the Office of the Special Census Bureau, 425 Avenue of the Americas (at 10th Street) on Friday, May 24, 1957, between the hours of 11:00 AM and 5:00 PM. Your representative shall bring with him a statement on which will be shown the name of the department and the number of canvass forms required.",
